    "summary": "Network probe has not run for 5 minutes",
    "description": "net_probe_last_run_timestamp_seconds is older than 300 s: native-net-probe.timer has stopped or the textfile was not rewritten. Until it runs again ns2604-net-silent-crit falls back to the plain traffic test and ns2604-net-probe-crit reads no data and stays normal (it reads the probe only at 300 s old or less). Records: ALERT-NET-PROBE-20261014.md."
